# A Luxel library scene (Gitea #785) — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# No pattern at all: a colour wash, two sprites (an animated ring STRETCHED by
# `fit fill` to beat around a still heart) and a caption scrolling underneath.
# A scene does not need an engine to be worth playing.
S - Heartbeat
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Wash
K 140208
L sprite 2 1 20 20 add 100 none fill 1
N Pulse
I @spr/pulse-ring
L sprite 7 6 9 8 normal 100 none fill 1
N Heart
I @spr/heart
L text 0 24 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Caption
T lit LOVE
F tiny ff6688 c left 14
